    <panel_attributes>title=SD05 - Find or Generate Recipe   (UC03; F03, F04, F06, F11, F12)\nGUI calls reach the facade through MealPlanningApi (HTTP, as in SD01), the CLI calls it in-process
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:RecipeTool~RT
obj=:RecipeRepository~RR
obj=:ExternalRecipeAdapter\n«RecipeDataSource»~RDS
obj=Recipe Provider API\n«external»~RAPI
obj=:PlanningStrategyFactory~SF
obj=strategy:\nPlanningStrategy~ST
obj=:PromptBuilder~PB
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV
obj=:NutritionService~NS

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: "Quick high-protein\ndinner, max 20 min"
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: recommendRecipe(query); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 3: recommendRecipe(query); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC + : 4:\nbuildContext(\nrequest)
tick=1
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 5: recommendRecipes(\ncontext, query); on=AG
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 6: generateStructured(prompt, NextAction schema); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 7: tool call: recipeSearch(query); off=LLM
text=AG:one step of the tool\nloop shown in SD01
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 8: isValidCall(toolName,\nargs); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 9: true; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 10: execute(toolName, args); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT : 11: execute(args); on=RT
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT + : 12:\nsearchRecipes(\nquery)
tick=1
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RR : 13: search(query); on=RR
RR.&gt;RT : 14: local recipes; off=RR
combinedFragment=opt~O RT RAPI; RR:[too few local matches]
RT-&gt;&gt;&gt;RDS : 15: find(query); on=RDS
RDS-&gt;&gt;&gt;RAPI : 16: searchRecipes(params); on=RAPI
RAPI.&gt;RDS : 17: provider results; off=RAPI
RDS.&gt;RT : 18: List&lt;Recipe&gt; (toRecipe mapping); off=RDS
--=O
RT.&gt;TM : 19: ToolResult(candidates); off=RT
TM.&gt;AG : 20: ToolResult; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG + : 21:\nrankRecipes(\ncandidates,\ncontext)
tick=1
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF : 22: strategyFor(context); on=SF
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;SF + : 23:\ncreateStrategy(\nmode)
tick=1
SF-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 24: configure(profile)
SF.&gt;AG : 25: strategy; off=SF
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 26: rank(candidates, context); on=ST
ST.&gt;AG : 27: ranked list; off=ST
combinedFragment=alt~A AG LLM; TM:[no compatible candidate, or custom recipe requested]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG + : 28:\ngenerateRecipe(\ncontext,query)
tick=1
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;PB : 29: buildRecipePrompt(context, query); on=PB
PB.&gt;AG : 30: prompt; off=PB
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 31: generateStructured(prompt, Recipe schema); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 32: recipe data; off=LLM
AG.&gt;AC : 33: Recipe (source =\nGENERATED)
..=A; TM:[compatible candidates found]
AG.&gt;AC : 34: ranked recipes with\nrationale; off=AG
--=A
combinedFragment=loop~L AC NS; AG:[each recipe to return]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 35: validateRestrictions(recipe, profile); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 36: ValidationResult (allergens, dislikes, time); off=CV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;NS : 37: calculateNutrition(recipe, servings); on=NS
NS.&gt;AC : 38: NutritionSummary (complete flag); off=NS
--=L
combinedFragment=alt~B GUI NS; F:[at least one valid recipe]
AC.&gt;F : 39: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nrecipes, rationale)
..=B; F:[generated recipe invalid, or nothing compatible]
AC.&gt;F : 40: AgentResponse(\nCONFLICT, trade-offs); off=AC
--=B
F.&gt;GUI : 41: AgentResponse; off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 42: recipes with time, cost,\nand nutrition</panel_attributes>
